runtime/packed_decode.py is an independent mathematical packed-layout decoder:
little-endian B-bit two's-complement UINT8[ceil(K*B/8),N] -> INT8[N,K].
The operator reports implementation from that specification without reading the
removed GPL decoder. SM89 black-box parity checked 10 W5/W6 cases and 169,939,328
integer codes. This is an engineering provenance statement, not formal legal
clean-room certification. Removed historical code is not relicensed by this file.

